# Kiribe list URL state

## Rules

1. Sync list UI state to URL query params — never hold `page`, `q`, `view`, or filters only in React state
2. Use shared hooks: `usePagination`, `useFilter`, `useDebouncedUrlParam`, `useListViewMode`, `useModalRoute`
3. Compose editorial fetching in `useArticlesList` — do not duplicate query wiring in page components
4. Import limits and debounce from `@/constants` — never hardcode `24`, `300`, etc. in components or API routes
5. Client list reads use app routes `/api/articles` and `/api/search`, not Payload REST directly
6. Reset `page` to 1 when search, filter, or view mode changes
7. Server must always `clampLimit()` — never trust client `limit`

## Reference

- Constants: `src/constants/app.constants.ts`
- Content layer: `src/lib/content/`
- Architect memory: `.claude/agent-memory/software-architect/url-state-pagination.md`
